İfade: 5 VARNAME | test
İfade: 5 OPERATOR | +
İfade: 5 DECNUMBER | 10
MQuaLix DBG: (dönmedi)

İfade: 6 KEYWORD | else
MQuaLix DBG: (dönmedi)

İfade: 7 VARNAME | test
İfade: 7 OPERATOR | +
İfade: 7 DECNUMBER | 5
MQuaLix DBG: (dönmedi)

İfade: 8 KEYWORD | endif
MQuaLix DBG: (dönmedi)

İfade: 9 KEYWORD | print
